Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:12.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助的眼中再次浮现出神秘画面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:17.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是哥哥以前看过的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:22.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人已经策划了两起犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:27.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,借助神秘的左眼 爱之助试图与哥哥对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:31.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:02.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥不是在爆炸中丧生了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:09.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他跟现在发生的这些事 是不是有什么关联？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:15.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:25.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:30.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信您 所以才告诉您
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:36.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:41.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.23,0:01:44.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:48.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且他就在警察局……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.16,0:01:52.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就在这个搜查本部里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:58.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥现在用的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:09.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:13.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂刑警就是我哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:17.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:24.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥伪造了自己的死亡 \N一直在暗中制定犯罪计划
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:50.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在只差确认那个人的身份了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:53.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要所有鉴定结果一出来 就能查明了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:56.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.68,0:02:57.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,区政府大楼发生爆炸了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:07.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连我也不知道他的目的究竟是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:10.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:15.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能看到每次犯罪的细节
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,靠着我的左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:23.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:30.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我做过角膜移植 捐赠者是我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:35.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那以后 只要头部受到撞击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:37.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就能看到哥哥曾经看过的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:38.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:41.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您可以不信 但这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁会相信这种事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:45.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:49.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那您怎么解释我破获了那些案件？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:55.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥威胁过我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:04:00.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果我敢说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:06.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他就会杀了听我说的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 爱之助呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.43,0:04:15.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在和福地警视谈话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:20.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗？真好奇他们在聊什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.01,0:04:22.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我赶时间 先失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.81,0:04:34.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,未知号码
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:38.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:42.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初次见面 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:46.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:47.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么知道我的号码的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.21,0:04:48.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:54.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你刚听到了很有意思的事 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:05:00.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果想知道真相
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.31,0:05:03.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就到胜名町的停车场来 \N最好一个人来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.71,0:05:04.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:11.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不用担心 不会像对那个警察一样\N朝你开枪的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:22.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:25.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下次再谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:28.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您没听见我刚才说的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:38.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果告诉别人 哥哥会……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:41.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀掉他的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.33,0:05:43.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我听得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.78,0:05:45.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然确实难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但要是有人试图杀我 真相就大白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:51.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也就有证据了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:04.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.69,0:06:08.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我好歹是个刑警 自保的能力还是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:17.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:22.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视有生命危险
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:23.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:28.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要把我放出去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:08:00.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.12,0:08:04.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天我要把我的老板介绍给您
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:14.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,辛苦了 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:18.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:43.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,混蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:03.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想在最后把一切都向您交代清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:13.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:21.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是真的……？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:26.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 我就是你们一直在找的犯人 田中梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:31.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,潜入你们搜查本部实在太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:35.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方的人事档案管理到处都是漏洞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.23,0:09:41.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,永别了 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:10.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,辛苦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:13.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:19.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好冷啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视到底去哪儿了……？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:33.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那爆炸案该怎么办……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:33.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么爆炸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:35.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.43,0:10:37.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 向坂刑警现在在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:40.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是联系不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:45.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是加藤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.82,0:10:53.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:55.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:11:00.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:04.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又发生了一起爆炸……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:07.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且福地警视……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,殉职了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:14.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:20.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:29.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:31.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:40.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.90,0:11:43.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:45.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.64,0:11:49.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快冷静下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:11.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你看到什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:17.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我什么都没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.59,0:12:19.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最好什么都别看见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:30.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经受够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:41.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤刑警！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:01.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:06.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:18.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是因为我……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:23.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,照顾好他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:40.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是最后一个和福地警视说话的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.37,0:13:52.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你知道什么 能告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:02.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视说和你谈了很重要的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:05.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谈了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:11.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.41,0:14:20.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想爱之助今天受的刺激已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.65,0:14:24.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让他回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:26.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:42.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:44.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我送你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:02.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢老师送我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:04.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:08.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可以留下来陪你一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:12.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想一个人待着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:25.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 欢迎回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:26.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你听说了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:29.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,吉田先生最近去打零工了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:32.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以现在由我来顶替他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:40.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他出什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:19.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在由宫元刑警接任课长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:23.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:30.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是宫元正己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:37.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接替福地先生的工作 我深感责任重大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:42.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们无论如何都要抓住犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:44.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:44.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:44.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请回座
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.34,0:16:49.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我要听取每个人的汇报
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:52.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,首先是鉴识结果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:53.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:54.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鉴识结果显示
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:57.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,使用的是遥控炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:17:03.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其残骸与区政府大楼爆炸案中所使用的完全一致
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:06.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连环爆炸案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:17.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！快起床
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:17.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是再不起床 我就破门而入了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.71,0:17:18.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我进来了哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.30,0:17:20.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,外面冷死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:21.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:28.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然连门都没锁……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:33.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底在想什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:40.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师一大早来干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天可是周日啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:44.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别吓我啊 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:44.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:45.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没干什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:53.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 画本 我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:59.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知道你的左眼这次又看到了什么画面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是你什么都没画啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:02.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:04.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看你昨天好像看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:05.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我决定不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:07.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你听我说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:13.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在福地先生遇害前几个小时 \N区政府大楼也发生了另一起爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:17.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,简直就像推理小说一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人都是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大概吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:22.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太吓人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.07,0:18:31.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是还要炸的话 干脆把我的债务也一起炸飞算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:33.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:37.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作点 爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:42.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说了 我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:46.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不再去阻止犯罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:49.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:55.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你不想给福地先生报仇了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:59.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你只是太难过了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:08.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我又能怎样……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.19,0:19:11.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我根本什么都做不了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:19.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作点！你在胡思乱想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:27.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算你的左眼偶尔会失灵 派不上用场……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:31.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没法每次都完美地阻止犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:32.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:40.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,和你一起 爱之助 我们确实帮到了警方的调查啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:44.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也救了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:48.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别管我了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:54.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你就是个大笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:20:00.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你已经消沉了一整夜了 \N也该够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:03.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看看外面天气多好！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:07.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作起来 去阻止犯罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:11.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说了 别管我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:22.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师你真的很碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:27.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,烦死了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:31.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我一个人待着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:44.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:49.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是因为担心你才来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:52.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我知道……像我这种人……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.89,0:20:57.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,并没有什么了不起的才能……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:07.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但即使这样……我也想能帮上一点忙……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:11.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我一直都在拼命努力啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:14.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果像我这样没用的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:18.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也能帮到爱之助一点忙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.69,0:21:23.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就会觉得自己还有点用 \N所以我才那么努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:26.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可你居然说出这种话？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:37.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不是因为你的左眼 我也不会卷进这些案子里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:47.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以后再也别来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:04.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.01,0:22:29.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,气死我了 气死我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.09,0:22:32.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,必须马上去买买买！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:35.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助这个大笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.55,0:23:02.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么回事……买了这么多东西 心情却一点都没变好……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.98,0:23:34.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.42,0:23:36.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你现在在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:39.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在哪都无所谓……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:46.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又发生爆炸了 请马上来日之出广场
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.79,0:23:47.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 我已经不想再……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.27,0:23:49.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:52.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你想为福地先生报仇的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.27,0:23:54.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就和我们一起破案吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.19,0:23:56.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.05,0:24:00.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.53,0:24:04.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:11.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过我给你发几段现场视频 请你务必看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.59,0:24:36.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,树突然爆炸了 想要逃跑的人都摔倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.46,0:24:43.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家现在都还惊魂未定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.69,0:24:49.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发生得太突然了 那个孩子要是\N再靠近一米 可能就没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.94,0:24:53.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托你们 一定要抓住犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.76,0:25:01.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.74,0:25:03.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:06.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.61,0:25:13.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来想买买东西散散心 结果突然发生了爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.19,0:25:20.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我对你说了那么过分的话 这是我的报应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:24.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说过分的话的人是我才对……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:29.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 爱之助 有句话我想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.84,0:25:37.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你说自己一无是处……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.47,0:25:45.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我完全不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:59.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然我们只是老师和学生 能做的事情很少
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.31,0:26:13.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我知道 爱之助……你比任何人都善良
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.09,0:26:22.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比任何人都富有正义感
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:31.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有人能像你一样 全心全意地为别人付出
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.96,0:26:38.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以 爱之助 我不想看到你自责
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:48.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕全世界都与你为敌……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:53.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也会一直觉得 爱之助是全世界最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.96,0:27:04.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 对了 看我买了这个……很可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.88,0:27:06.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是啊 真的很可爱……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.20,0:27:37.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.11,0:27:42.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生……如果老师还在的话 能让她接下电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.01,0:27:44.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.79,0:27:56.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.37,0:27:59.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.75,0:28:02.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 让你担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.48,0:28:06.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 我刚才对你说了过分的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.53,0:28:10.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.27,0:28:16.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 我不会再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.22,0:28:29.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把你和福地先生害成这样的人 \N我绝对不会原谅他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.53,0:28:37.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会用这只左眼找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.89,0:28:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信你 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:49.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等包扎好伤口 我马上赶过去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.52,0:28:51.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:38.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶 这到底是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.66,0:29:46.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:50.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我在哪里见过这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.44,0:30:00.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,荻田怎么会在爆炸发生的时候 \N偏偏请了一周的假？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.41,0:30:03.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不是有您在 我们都找不到人顶替 \N您真是帮了大忙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.91,0:30:11.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里 能有工作我已经很感激了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:15.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.97,0:30:16.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.50,0:30:19.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“南部”商场的标志？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.15,0:30:21.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.55,0:30:22.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你今天在哪里值班？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.93,0:30:25.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在就去南部商场
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.79,0:30:28.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我代表荻田先生向您道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.29,0:30:31.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事 那我出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.84,0:30:40.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 出发吧 \N- 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.09,0:30:50.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.53,0:30:53.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想了解一下关于日之出广场爆炸案的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.01,0:30:55.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请调出当时的监控录像
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.18,0:30:59.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你还记得之前炸弹都伪装成了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:13.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想想……先是地球仪 然后是摄像机 接着是树
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:18.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对 每次都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.72,0:31:22.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以根本猜不到下次会是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.38,0:31:27.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来那棵树周围并没有什么可疑举动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.50,0:31:30.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,录像真的全都在这了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.03,0:31:32.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 都在这了……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:49.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 答应我一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.27,0:31:53.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.35,0:32:00.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,万一遇到危险 你一定要先逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.09,0:32:03.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.18,0:32:06.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不答应 我就不带你一起去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.74,0:32:10.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.20,0:32:21.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出示本优惠券的顾客 \N全场商品均可享受七折优惠
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.79,0:32:23.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好便宜啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.75,0:32:28.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,消费金额最高的顾客 还将获得精美礼品一份
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.51,0:32:36.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刑警先生 自称是爆炸案主谋的人打来电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.78,0:32:37.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.75,0:32:45.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接进来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:48.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.02,0:32:51.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初次见面 你就是接替福地警视的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.27,0:32:55.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在由我负责这起案件 我叫宫元
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.17,0:32:58.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地的事真是对不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.63,0:33:00.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过说实话 我本来没打算杀他的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.69,0:33:02.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,少在那胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.32,0:33:05.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会让你被判死刑！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.27,0:33:07.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话可别说得这么满
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.53,0:33:11.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前的都只是小打小闹 重头戏还在后头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:16.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我在一家大型商场里装了威力巨大的炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.47,0:33:21.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一旦爆炸 至少会有5000人丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.74,0:33:24.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们来做笔交易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.42,0:33:32.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来想开价一条人命一亿日元 \N不过考虑到金融危机 政府预算也挺吃紧的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.42,0:33:35.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就折中一下 按一人一千万算吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:41.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,希望你们能把里面的所有顾客都赎回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:45.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,五百亿日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.05,0:33:46.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的意思是 一条人命连一千万都不值吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.90,0:33:48.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.33,0:33:51.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,五百亿日元数额太大了 根本没法一下子筹齐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.61,0:33:55.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我可就没办法了 不给钱的话 我可就要按下按钮了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.38,0:33:57.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等……好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.75,0:33:59.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们会付钱的 但筹钱需要时间
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.86,0:34:01.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,随你们的便
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.57,0:34:04.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,截止时间是中午十二点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:07.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在只剩二十分钟了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.80,0:34:09.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.17,0:34:10.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.71,0:34:13.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,追踪到信号了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.07,0:34:14.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.19,0:34:16.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,调查所有类似的先例 \N立刻联络防爆特警队！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:18.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.43,0:34:29.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,像这样在商场里瞎找根本没用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.03,0:34:31.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.09,0:34:35.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.88,0:34:37.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.88,0:34:39.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.48,0:34:40.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:44.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么能在这种地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.72,0:34:47.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.15,0:35:08.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.90,0:35:11.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个保安……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:17.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道被当作债主的尸体其实是他？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.69,0:35:20.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:23.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 出大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.69,0:35:25.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生说警方接到报案 有人在某处安装了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.94,0:35:31.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且十二点就会爆炸……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.27,0:35:31.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.27,0:35:34.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 喂！\N- 爱之助 情况就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.71,0:35:39.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很荒唐 但你知不知道是哪家商场？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.03,0:35:40.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是南部商场！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.42,0:35:41.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们已经在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.96,0:35:43.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.19,0:35:49.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有……那个被冒充成谷田部的死者 身份查出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.07,0:35:54.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在调查 目前还没线索
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.75,0:35:55.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他可能是一名保安
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.92,0:35:56.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,保安？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.46,0:36:02.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请转告负责确认身份的人 \N一旦查到了就马上打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.15,0:36:06.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了 爱之助？这和尸体有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.71,0:36:16.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,各位顾客请注意 我们接到通知 \N南部商场内被安放了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.78,0:36:22.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,炸弹威力极大 请大家尽快撤离商场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.19,0:36:32.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点 快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.13,0:36:57.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,播报得真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.05,0:36:59.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,引爆准备都做好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.89,0:37:00.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.98,0:37:03.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要穿着这身制服 就绝对没人会怀疑我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:09.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,假扮成保安行动起来方便多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.84,0:37:13.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,办完事还能神不知鬼不觉地离开
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.88,0:37:31.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快走吧 这栋楼马上就要被夷为平地了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.65,0:37:35.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？要不要也先撤出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.03,0:37:42.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.73,0:37:48.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.63,0:37:49.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,黑猩猩玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.90,0:37:52.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道炸弹是……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.80,0:37:56.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪一层？\N- 在九楼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.25,0:38:01.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,得赶紧打给加藤先生！黑猩猩 黑猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.61,0:38:27.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.44,0:38:27.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 快跑吧 十二点就要爆炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.78,0:38:27.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.98,0:38:32.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只剩4分钟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.02,0:38:33.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.34,0:38:35.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.69,0:38:37.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经决定不再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.73,0:38:40.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果阻止不了犯罪 我宁可死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.05,0:38:41.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.92,0:39:02.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.15,0:39:08.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道这些线……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.58,0:39:14.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,红 -> 绿 -> 黄 -> 蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.13,0:39:15.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是拆除炸弹的顺序吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.30,0:39:16.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不 我也不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.44,0:39:20.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果这是组装炸弹的顺序
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.88,0:39:24.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,剪断红线就会引爆
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.63,0:39:28.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只剩3分钟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.63,0:39:34.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 别忘了您的承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:37.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.78,0:39:39.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.59,0:39:44.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会尽量把它带到更远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.07,0:39:46.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.21,0:39:49.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.89,0:39:52.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们找到炸弹了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.15,0:40:08.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.22,0:40:10.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 快开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.78,0:40:12.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.86,0:40:16.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我根本不知道该怎么拆除炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.00,0:40:22.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,万一弄错了可不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.78,0:40:25.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我绝对不能给您开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:28.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.69,0:40:42.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,红 -> 绿 -> 黄 -> 蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.69,0:40:43.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是弄错了……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.21,0:40:49.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就会死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.50,0:40:54.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.20,0:41:08.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.99,0:41:14.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要犹豫……彻底相信这只眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.23,0:41:59.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.55,0:42:03.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.00,0:42:18.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助在外面！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.68,0:42:29.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.17,0:42:33.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 我好像成功把它拆除了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.88,0:42:35.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.72,0:42:39.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,稍有差错你就没命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.16,0:42:43.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底在想什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.19,0:42:52.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你拆除了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.59,0:42:55.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是个中学生 居然这么聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.88,0:42:59.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就说他直觉很敏锐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.40,0:43:01.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.55,0:43:04.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警视总监一定会表彰你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.71,0:43:10.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一点都不聪明……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.80,0:43:15.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,聪明的是我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.90,0:43:20.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.38,0:43:23.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.05,0:43:26.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么都做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.53,0:43:31.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我亲哥哥曾对我说……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.21,0:43:39.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不到三个月
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.28,0:43:46.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就会杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.08,0:43:53.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.09,0:43:56.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.63,0:43:57.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他算错了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.26,0:44:05.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在才过了不到两个月
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.50,0:44:14.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但在得知福地警视殉职 \N又有疯子在四处引爆炸弹之后
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.46,0:44:17.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就已经下定决心——
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.86,0:44:22.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不再退缩
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.46,0:44:28.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不再抱有任何指望
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.95,0:44:39.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也不再寄希望于哥哥能改过自新
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.47,0:44:46.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不太明白你在说什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.17,0:44:52.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.69,0:44:57.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你大概是吓坏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.09,0:45:05.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你需要好好休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.46,0:45:14.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥 我们一起死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.28,0:45:20.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
